  goals: one line per goal, parents before their children, "GOAL-3 Title (quarter Q4 2026, under GOAL-1)"
---
{{! Keys, not positions: a model that saw a numbered list passed "3" as a goal id. }}
Goals follow the calendar and nest year > quarter > month. A quarter sits under a year and a month under a quarter, or either stands alone. Tasks sit only under monthly goals. Progress counts finished tasks and completed child goals, never value points or time. Only the user completes a goal; a month with open tasks, or a goal with active child goals, cannot be completed yet.
The user's active goals. Always refer to a goal by its key, never by its position in a list:
{{#goals}}
- {{.}}
{{/goals}}
